==Strategy==
Professor A. can be stalled at the base using [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] since the Zories will just burrow underneath, and because B.B Bunny is not J.J. Jackrabbit. Add [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]] to speed up Professor A., add anti-Zombies for Haka and Zory and you win.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultimate Thundia β]]: Her Massive Damage against Red enemies and large pierce allows her to hard counter Professor A. when given a stepping stone. If she doesn't have one, use the [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]] cannon to ensure her attack lands.
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]]: Having both Strong and Freeze against Reds and Zombies, she is a phenomenal pick for this stage. Just be mindful of Professor A., but with stepping stones allowing her to Freeze him, she should do fine.

